### 聊天接口验收测试脚本
### 使用方式：在IntelliJ IDEA中打开此文件，点击每行左侧的绿色运行按钮

### 基础URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. 健康检查（无需认证）
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. 通用法律咨询（需要认证）
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/legal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "message": "劳动合同未签订双倍工资怎么计算？"
}

### 3. RAG检索问答（需要认证）
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/rag
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "question": "劳动合同纠纷如何处理？",
  "topK": 5
}

### 4. 通用法律咨询 - 刑事案件
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/legal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "message": "涉嫌交通肇事罪应该怎么处理？"
}

### 5. 通用法律咨询 - 民事纠纷
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/legal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "message": "邻居装修噪音扰民怎么办？"
}

### 6. RAG检索问答 - 合同相关
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/rag
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "question": "房屋买卖合同违约金如何计算？",
  "topK": 3
}

### 7. 通用法律咨询 - 婚姻家庭
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/legal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "message": "离婚后孩子抚养费怎么计算？"
}

### 8. RAG检索问答 - 劳动争议
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/rag
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "question": "加班费计算基数是什么？",
  "topK": 5
}

### 预期响应示例

#### 健康检查响应 (200 OK)
{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "success",
  "data": {
    "status": "ok",
    "service": "Chat Service",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "features": "legal,rag"
  }
}

#### 法律咨询响应 (200 OK)
{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "success",
  "data": "【问题理解】\n您询问的是劳动合同未签订情形下双倍工资的计算问题...\n\n【法律分析】\n1. 相关法律规定：\n   - 《劳动合同法》第八十二条...\n..."
}

#### RAG检索问答响应 (200 OK)
{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "success",
  "data": {
    "answer": "根据知识库文档，劳动合同纠纷处理流程如下...",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "劳动合同纠纷处理指南",
        "category": "劳动法",
        "relevanceScore": "0.95",
        "summary": "本文档介绍劳动合同纠纷的处理流程..."
      },
      ...
    ],
    "hasAnswer": true,
    "documentCount": 3,
    "searchMethod": "Vector Search + LLM"
  }
}

### 错误响应示例

#### 未授权 (401 Unauthorized)
{
  "timestamp": "2026-05-04T21:00:00.000+00:00",
  "status": 401,
  "error": "Unauthorized",
  "message": "Full authentication is required to access this resource"
}

#### AI配置未设置 (500 Internal Server Error)
{
  "code": 500,
  "message": "法律咨询失败: AI配置未设置，请先在系统设置中配置AI服务"
}

#### 检索无结果 (200 OK)
{
  "code": 200,
  "message": "success",
  "data": {
    "answer": "未找到相关文档。请尝试其他关键词。",
    "sources": [],
    "hasAnswer": false
  }
}
